*> Reason codes, hold reasons and abort causes. Text is what appears in
*> reject.csv, reconciliation.rpt and stderr. Keep in sync with docs/output_schema.md.
*> Record reject reasons (REJECTED state):
78 RJ-CHECKSUM VALUE "CHECKSUM".
78 RJ-RESERVED VALUE "RESERVED".
78 RJ-REVISION VALUE "REVISION".
78 RJ-NUMCLASS VALUE "NUMCLASS".
78 RJ-BADDATE VALUE "BADDATE".
78 RJ-PANELCNT VALUE "PANELCNT".
78 RJ-BADTYPE VALUE "BADTYPE".
78 RJ-ORPHAN VALUE "ORPHAN".
78 RJ-DUPPAT VALUE "DUPPAT".
78 RJ-BADSIGN VALUE "BADSIGN".
78 RJ-BADID VALUE "BADID".
*> Cohort hold reasons (HELD state):
78 HD-UNVERIFIABLE VALUE "UNVERIFIABLE".
78 HD-COUNT VALUE "COUNT".
78 HD-LABTOTAL VALUE "LABTOTAL".
78 HD-HASHTOTAL VALUE "HASHTOTAL".
